        <mxCell id="3kIGnBp9XE69dWjULhN5-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;There is a mismatch between my audio and the waveform. How do I fix it?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;If you&#39;re using a &lt;b&gt;VBR&lt;/b&gt; (variable bit rate) audio file, there might be a mismatch between the audio and the waveform. This can be fixed by converting your file to &lt;b&gt;CBR&lt;/b&gt; (constant bit rate).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Alternatively, you can use the Web Audio shim which is more accurate.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
